# Role "secretsclient": modules that declare the authorization
# openbao@any:secretsclient may ask for their own OpenBao token (client
# provisioning, off by default, every client approved by the
# administrator). get-client-status is also readable by the builtin
# reader role.

set -e
exec 1>&2
redis-exec SADD "${AGENT_ID}/roles/secretsclient" "provision-client" "request-client-access" "get-client-status"
